    "description": "Elegant and light-filled, this vacant two-unit building in the heart of the Inner Sunset has been lovingly maintained by the same family since its inception. Each unit features two spacious bedrooms, a formal living room, and two dining areas one of which has been used as an additional bedroom in the past. Beautifully refinished hardwood floors, fresh paint, and a wood-burning fireplace enhance the timeless charm, while the tiered backyard and full-length garage add functionality. With an unbeatable location just steps from Golden Gate Park, the vibrant dining and shopping scene along 9th & Irving, and effortless downtown access via the N Muni, this property offers exceptional potential for investors, owner-occupants, or those seeking a flexible live-rent opportunity in one of San Francisco's most desirable neighborhoods. A rare opportunity to own a legacy property in a prime location!"
